WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
[Background music]
Project spotlight: Pacífico Beauty Fulfillment. Conveyor and sortation line.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Before: finished orders pile up between packing and staging, and 11% miss the 3 p.m. cut-off.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:15.000
After: three sortation lanes route parcels by carrier. Same-day dispatch reaches 98.5%.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:21.500
Results: same-day dispatch 89% to 98.5% (+9.5 pp). Order accuracy 98.7% to 99.7% (+1.0 pp). Labor hours per 1,000 orders 46 to 33 (-28%).

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:25.000
Nexora Intralogistics Solutions.
